 px-4 py-2 font-body text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.14em] bg-soft-green text-green-deep">WE&#x27;RE HERE TO HELP</span><div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 mt-4.5"><h1 class="max-w-[760px] font-heading font-extrabold leading-none tracking-tight text-navy text-[38px] sm:text-[52px] lg:text-[clamp(38px,5vw,64px)]">Reach AJSMC in Egmore, Chennai</h1></div><p class="mt-4.5 max-w-[560px] font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-body">We are on Police Commissioner Office Road, a short walk from Egmore station. Call, WhatsApp or use the form below to book. Consultations run Monday to Saturday, 10am to 9pm, and our helpline answers around the clock.</p></div></section></div><section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1240px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 pb-2.5 pt-11"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4.5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><a href="https://share.google/cwOs9gRRkiI2E8dNM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block rounded-[20px] border aj-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-[0_22px_44px_-26px_rgba(12,46,110,0.4)]"><span class="mb-3.5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] bg-soft-green text-green-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg></span><h3 class="mb-1 font-heading text-base font-bold text-navy">Visit Us</h3><p class="font-body text-[13px] leading-snug text-muted">No.47 (31), Police Commissioner Office Road, Egmore, Chennai – 600008</p></a><a href="tel:04425322021" class="block rounded-[20px] border aj-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-[0_22px_44px_-26px_rgba(12,46,110,0.4)]"><span class="mb-3.5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] bg-soft-green text-green-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mb-1 font-heading text-base font-bold text-navy">Call Us</h3><p class="font-body text-[13px] leading-snug text-muted">044 2532 2021</p><p class="font-body text-[13px] leading-snug text-muted">+91 91506 42999</p></a><a href="mailto:helpdesk@ajsmc.in" class="block rounded-[20px] border aj-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-[0_22px_44px_-26px_rgba(12,46,110,0.4)]"><span class="mb-3.5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] bg-soft-green text-green-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg></span><h3 class="mb-1 font-heading text-base font-bold text-navy">Email Us</h3><p class="font-body text-[13px] leading-snug text-muted">helpdesk@ajsmc.in</p></a><div class="rounded-[20px] bg-navy p-6"><span class="mb-3.5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] bg-green-bright/[0.18] text-green-bright"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mb-1 font-heading text-base font-bold text-white">Opening Hours</h3><p class="font-body text-[13px] leading-snug text-white/72">Consultations <!-- -->Mon to Sat: 10am to 9pm<br/><span class="font-semibold text-green-bright">24-Hour Helpline</span></p></div></div></section><section id="form" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1240px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 grid grid-cols-1 items-stretch gap-6.5 py-16 pb-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(0,0.9fr)]"><div class="rounded-[26px] border aj-card p-8 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-40px_rgba(12,46,110,0.5)] sm:p-9"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-4 py-2 font-body text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.14em] bg-soft-green text-green-deep">SEND US A MESSAGE</span><h2 class="mb-1.5 mt-4 font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-[30px] lg:text-[clamp(24px,3vw,34px)]">Book a visit or ask a question</h2><p class="mb-6 max-w-[460px] font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Fill in your details and our team will get back to you shortly. Affordable specialist care, no heavy charges.</p><form><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block font-body text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Full Name</span><input type="text" required="" placeholder="Your name" class="aj-input"/></label><label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block font-body text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Phone Number</span><input type="tel" required="" placeholder="+91" class="aj-input"/></label><label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block font-body text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Email</span><input type="email" required="" placeholder="you@example.com" class="aj-input"/></label><label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block font-body text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Department</span><select required="" class="aj-input"><option value="" disabled="" selected="">Select a department</option><option value="Ophthalmology">Ophthalmology</option><option value="Dermatology">Dermatology</option><option value="Pediatrics">Pediatrics</option><option value="Orthopedics">Orthopedics</option><option value="Urology">Urology</option><option value="Obstetrics &amp; Gynaecology">Obstetrics &amp; Gynaecology</option><option value="General Medicine">General Medicine</option><option value="Diabetology">Diabetology</option><option value="Reproductive Medicine">Reproductive Medicine</option><option value="Psychology">Psychology</option><option value="Pathology">Pathology</option><option value="ENT">ENT</option><option value="Gastroenterology">Gastroenterology</option><option value="Nephrology">Nephrology</option><option value="Neurology">Neurology</option><option value="Oncology">Oncology</option><option value="Plastic Surgery">Plastic Surgery</option><option value="Pulmonology">Pulmonology</option><option value="Radiology">Radiology</option></select></label></div><label class="mt-4 block"><span class="mb-1.5 block font-body text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Message</span><textarea rows="4" placeholder="How can we help?" class="aj-input resize-y"></textarea></label><div class="mt-5.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5"><button type="submit" class="aj-cta-wave inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-navy py-[9px] pl-6 pr-[9px] font-body text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_16px_30px_-16px_rgba(12,46,110,0.7)]"><span>Send Message</span><span class="aj-cta-dot flex h-[38px] w-[38px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-bright text-[#083b20]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></button><span class="font-body text-sm font-medium text-muted">or call<!-- --> <a href="tel:04425322021" class="font-bold text-navy">044 2532 2021</a></span></div></form></div><div class="f